<div class="card">
  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">Yes.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">The questions people ask before they buy, and the answer to each. Every one is true today.</p>
  <style>.yes-q{padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e5e5e5)}.yes-h{font-size:1.05rem;margin:0 0 4px}</style>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-answer-by-voice-note-instead-of-typing"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I answer by voice note instead of typing?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Voice notes are written out for you, accents included. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-send-photos-as-i-walk-round"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I send photos as I walk round?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Each photo lands on the question it answers. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-answer-in-any-order"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I answer in any order?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Text, voice notes, photos, documents and location pins, in whatever order you come across things. <a href="/pages/how-it-works.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-my-team-use-the-whatsapp-they-already-have"><h2 class="yes-h">Can my team use the WhatsApp they already have?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> No new app, no login and very little to learn. <a href="/pages/any-phone.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="does-it-work-on-both-iphone-and-android"><h2 class="yes-h">Does it work on both iPhone and Android?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Any phone that runs WhatsApp or Telegram works. <a href="/pages/any-phone.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-we-use-telegram-instead-of-whatsapp"><h2 class="yes-h">Can we use Telegram instead of WhatsApp?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Each person can use WhatsApp or Telegram. <a href="/pages/any-phone.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-send-a-document-or-my-location"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I send a document or my location?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Both are accepted in the chat, alongside text, voice notes and photos. <a href="/pages/how-it-works.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="if-i-lose-signal-on-site-will-my-messages-still-arrive"><h2 class="yes-h">If I lose signal on site, will my messages still arrive?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> They wait, then arrive in the right order when you are back in signal. <a href="/pages/how-it-works.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="will-it-remind-me-what-i-have-not-mentioned-yet"><h2 class="yes-h">Will it remind me what I have not mentioned yet?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> After each message it shows what is still to cover, so nothing is forgotten on the way out. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-decide-when-the-inspection-is-finished"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I decide when the inspection is finished?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Nothing is filed until you say done. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-add-a-forgotten-fault-after-i-have-said-done"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I add a forgotten Fault after I have said done?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Tell it straight afterwards and the Record is reopened for it. You can also change any word on the Record itself.</p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-change-any-word-in-the-report-before-it-goes"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I change any word in the report before it goes?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Every word on the Record can be edited. <a href="/pages/how-it-works.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="is-every-change-kept-with-who-made-it-and-when"><h2 class="yes-h">Is every change kept, with who made it and when?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Every change to a Record is kept in its edit history. <a href="/pages/security.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-get-the-report-in-my-own-layout"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I get the report in my own layout?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Send a finished report in Word or PDF and every new one comes back looking like it. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-start-from-a-form-i-already-use-even-a-photo-of-a-paper-form"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I start from a form I already use, even a photo of a paper form?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Send Word, PDF, Excel or a photo and Quickler writes the questions from it. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-it-use-the-sentences-i-always-write"><h2 class="yes-h">Can it use the sentences I always write?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Send your reusable paragraphs. They only appear when the walk calls for them. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-my-logo-go-on-the-reports"><h2 class="yes-h">Can my logo go on the reports?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Add your logo once and it goes on your reports.</p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-download-a-record-as-pdf-word-excel-or-csv"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I download a Record as PDF, Word, Excel or CSV?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Download any Record yourself, whenever you like. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-download-a-whole-check-or-one-persons-records-in-one-go"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I download a whole Check, or one person&#x27;s Records, in one go?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Each comes as a zip, with every Record in its own folder. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-share-a-record-with-someone-who-has-no-account"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I share a Record with someone who has no account?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Send them a link. It needs no login to open and stays open for a year. <a href="/pages/security.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="does-every-fault-go-on-a-to-do-list"><h2 class="yes-h">Does every Fault go on a To do list?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Each Fault is listed with where it is. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-copy-the-to-do-list-and-send-it-on"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I copy the To do list and send it on?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> It is laid out ready to copy and send. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-add-to-the-to-do-list-hide-a-line-or-change-the-order"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I add to the To do list, hide a line or change the order?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Yes, on the Record, so the list matches the job you actually want done.</p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-send-a-check-now-as-a-one-off"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I send a Check now, as a one-off?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Send it now, or set it to repeat. <a href="/pages/how-it-works.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-a-check-repeat-on-a-schedule"><h2 class="yes-h">Can a Check repeat on a schedule?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Pick the days and times, or every few days, weeks or months. <a href="/pages/help/workflows.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="will-people-who-have-not-answered-be-chased"><h2 class="yes-h">Will people who have not answered be chased?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> They get a reminder, then another, and managers are told. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-several-people-do-the-same-check-at-once"><h2 class="yes-h">Can several people do the same Check at once?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Each person&#x27;s walk is its own Record.</p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-send-a-cancelled-check-again"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I send a cancelled Check again?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Yes, from the dashboard.</p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-add-as-many-people-as-i-like"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I add as many people as I like?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Add each person&#x27;s name and mobile number. That is all they need. <a href="/pages/how-it-works.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-the-office-have-dashboard-accounts-too"><h2 class="yes-h">Can the office have dashboard accounts too?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Invite people by email and choose admin or member. <a href="/pages/help/team.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-build-my-own-check"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I build my own Check?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> A Check is your own questions and report layout, built once and used as often as you like. <a href="/pages/help/workflows.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="is-it-only-for-one-kind-of-firm"><h2 class="yes-h">Is it only for one kind of firm?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> A Check is whatever questions you give it, so any team that inspects or keeps records can use it. <a href="/pages/features.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="do-i-still-read-and-sign-the-report-myself"><h2 class="yes-h">Do I still read and sign the report myself?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Quickler writes it up. You read it, change what you like and sign it, as you always have. <a href="/pages/how-it-works.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="is-the-price-simply-per-phone-number"><h2 class="yes-h">Is the price simply per phone number?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> £75 a month for each phone number on the account. <a href="/pages/pricing.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-pay-by-direct-debit"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I pay by Direct Debit?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Billed monthly by UK Direct Debit. Quickler does not store card numbers. <a href="/pages/pricing.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-leave-without-being-locked-in"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I leave without being locked in?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> You pay monthly. There is no annual contract. <a href="/reliable/">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-take-all-my-data-with-me"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I take all my data with me?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Download every Record and we delete our copy. <a href="/pages/security.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="is-my-data-kept-in-europe"><h2 class="yes-h">Is my data kept in Europe?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Quickler runs on Hetzner servers in the EU. <a href="/pages/security.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="is-quickler-registered-with-the-ico"><h2 class="yes-h">Is Quickler registered with the Information Commission (formerly the ICO)?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Quickler Ltd is registered with the Information Commission, number ZC124993. <a href="/pages/privacy.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="does-the-data-stay-mine"><h2 class="yes-h">Does the data stay mine?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> You are the controller and Quickler is the processor. <a href="/pages/security.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-ask-for-my-data-to-be-deleted"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I ask for my data to be deleted?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Yes. Records are also deleted three years after the last activity. <a href="/pages/security.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-rely-on-it-being-backed-up-and-watched"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I rely on it being backed up and watched?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> The database is copied about every 60 seconds, and the app is checked every 5 minutes. <a href="/reliable/">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-see-whether-quickler-is-working-right-now"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I see whether Quickler is working right now?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> An outside service checks it every 5 minutes and the real numbers are published. <a href="/status/">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-see-it-before-i-sign-anything"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I see it before I sign anything?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Send one message to the demo and watch a report come together. <a href="/pages/demo.html">See it.</a></p></div>
  <div class="yes-q" id="can-i-talk-to-a-real-person"><h2 class="yes-h">Can I talk to a real person?</h2><p class="site-words"><strong>Yes.</strong> Email hello@quickler.co. A person replies within one business day.</p></div>
</div>
